# Choked Estuary: "As this land enters, you may reveal an Island or Swamp card from your hand. If you don't, this land
# enters tapped." (CR 614.1d, 701.20a). The second type counts as well as the first: Bot1's hand holds only Swamps beside
# the land, it reveals one, and Choked Estuary enters untapped. A land that took only Islands would offer nothing to reveal
# and enter tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Choked Estuary
Swamp x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Choked Estuary.Play
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Swamp)
? Bot1.Revealed = Swamp
? Bot1.Battlefield.Choked Estuary.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Choked Estuary.Tapped = false
